<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Semicon Jan-Mar pretax off 49 pct.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Semicon Jan-Mar pretax off 49 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>January-March 1997</p>
<p>			 (in million T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover				7,604 vs 10,323</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			 2,896 vs  5,683</p>
<p>    Net profit			    3,069 vs  5,529</p>
<p>NOTE - Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing Co is Taiwan's largest semiconductor maker. It has set a 1997 pretax profit target of T$8.021 billion on sales of T$35.22 billion. The company said it expects second quarter sales to rise significantly compared with first quarter performance.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
